21:11.895 --> 21:19.281
[SPEAKER_00]: Previously, 2020 was a bit of a downer. I was very focused on the XP back then. I'm a much better pilot now, so it's interesting. It would have

21:19.301 --> 21:26.927
[SPEAKER_00]: been interesting to see how I went back then. But yeah, I was quite excited, very motivated for the 2020 race. And then all the uncertainty

21:26.967 --> 21:33.151
